OL,3,GNEWSANew park and ride site off the M11
OL,4,Awins approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site will be on the opposite side
OL,7,Fof the motorway to the existing
OL,8,FTrumpington park and ride site. Greater
OL,9,FCambridge Partnership (GCP) said that
OL,10,Ffacility, which has 1,600 spaces, was
OL,11,Foften full.
